\begin_layout Standard
To compare a slightly better explored approach, the same Sarsa approach
 was trained for 200 steps.
 Uncertainties still exist, but they play a much smaller role and the performanc
e increases accordingly by almost 5 steps to 
\begin_inset Formula $\approx-103.4$
\end_inset

.
